  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.4.0 adds prepared FP32 EmbeddingGemma 2 text-graph execution, LessOrEqual and exact RMS normalization fusion, CPU matrix/GELU improvements, and tensor lifetime and correctness fixes. The .NET 10 core has no runtime dependencies: ONNX file loading requires IOnnxModelReader; OnnxImport, ProtoConversions and generated messages moved to the source Protobuf adapter, so existing clients must rebuild with an adapter reference. Data embedding/audio APIs, CLI and the reference adapter remain nonpackable source projects. See CHANGELOG.md for migration and limitations; published benchmarks retain their measured revisions.",
